// Buildings the server adds to Bridgewatch (cluster 2000; analysis/work/stageN/stations/SPEC.md, Content/StationSpawns): the same ownerless
// public crafting and refining stations as Thetford's (content/spawns/0000.json), one per RealEstate plot centre of the 2000 template
// (20 x 20 plots, best locationquality first, then nearest the bank entrance).
// City bonus (craftingmodifiers.xml by cluster, applied by the station handler to the map the crafter stands on):
